WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.630
Wow! This supermarket is huge!

2
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.650
Look at all of these fruits and vegetables.

3
00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:23.370
I should eat more vegetables.

4
00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:31.210
Good idea, Anna. You must eat more vegetables. Like celery.

5
00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:35.410
Celery? Do you know what the web says about celery?

6
00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:36.430
No. What?

7
00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:43.030
Celery is 95% water, 100% not ice cream.

8
00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:47.370
I love the web.

9
00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:53.170
Anna, you mustn't eat junk food. Junk food will kill you.

10
00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:55.230
You are being silly.

11
00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:57.590
No, you are.

12
00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:59.270
No, you are.

13
00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:02.730
Will you two please be nice to each other?

14
00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.550
It is important to eat healthy foods.

15
00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:11.490
But a little junk food will not kill me.

16
00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:17.090
Ice cream. Ice cream does sound good.

17
00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:20.430
Take this cart to the frozen food aisle.

18
00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:26.650
No, wait. Go back. Go back. We forgot fruit. Go back.

19
00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:31.530
It is important to eat healthy foods.

20
00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:49.070
Okay, we are in the frozen food aisle.

21
00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:51.110
Mmm, ice cream.

22
00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:53.570
Mmm, frozen peas.

23
00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:00.470
Nobody says mmm, frozen peas. They say mmm, ice cream.

24
00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:02.590
Mmm, frozen peas.

25
00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:04.030
Mmm, ice cream.

26
00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:08.770
I am not going to tell you two again. Stop fighting.

27
00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:27.310
Mmm, I smell fresh bread.

28
00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:38.770
I love the smells of a bakery.

29
00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:45.970
Oh, Anna, let's buy a fresh loaf of whole wheat organic bread.

30
00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:52.350
You don't have to buy bread. Buy some donuts, Anna.

31
00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:57.190
You mustn't buy donuts. They are only fat and sugar.

32
00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:03.170
Exactly. You know, you are really no fun at all.

33
00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:06.550
And you must think having high cholesterol is fun.

34
00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:11.210
Everyone likes donuts. That is why you don't have friends.

35
00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:14.330
And that is why your cholesterol is so high.

36
00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:17.130
My cholesterol is none of your business.

37
00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:18.830
And I have lots of friends.
